WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:03.037 --> 00:00:04.265
Terry!

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:12.868
Susanna was rehearsing
the role of Juliet on stage.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:19.241
She saved Terrius,
but lost her right leg because of this.

00:00:20.621 --> 00:00:22.081
Meanwhile,

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:25.319
Candy headed
towards the Principal's villa

00:00:25.526 --> 00:00:31.089
and met Karen, an actress.

00:00:32.566 --> 00:00:36.866
The two of them didn't know anything
about Susanna's accident.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:46.104
An invitation with a one-way ticket.

00:00:48.983 --> 00:00:51.510
- I am back.
- Welcome.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.143
Here's the Principal's reply.

00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:55.814
How is the Principal?

00:00:55.964 --> 00:00:57.383
He's well.

00:00:57.533 --> 00:00:59.085
Good.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:01.962
How is Florida?

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:04.361
It's a beautiful place.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.192
It's summer there all year.

00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:12.630
Is there anything else, Dr. Leonard?

00:01:13.774 --> 00:01:16.472
Are you rushing home?

00:01:18.112 --> 00:01:21.173
You are on leave now,
there is nothing for you to do here.

00:01:21.323 --> 00:01:23.175
Take a good rest.

00:01:23.325 --> 00:01:26.549
Thank you! See you later!

00:01:31.959 --> 00:01:34.997
A present
for the man who lost his memory?

00:01:35.237 --> 00:01:36.520
Yes.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:40.530
No, and for Dr. Leonard as well.

00:01:42.303 --> 00:01:43.827
Please take it.

00:01:44.705 --> 00:01:46.002
Good bye.

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:51.172
I have only one.

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.776
I am back, Mr. Thomas!

00:01:54.782 --> 00:01:55.844
Welcome!

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:59.215
- You become darker.
- Hey!

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:01.245
Stop staring at me.

00:02:01.989 --> 00:02:03.815
Here, a present for you!

00:02:03.965 --> 00:02:07.049
Thanks, I will take it.

00:02:07.199 --> 00:02:08.092
Where is Mr. Albert?

00:02:08.395 --> 00:02:09.488
He is in his room.

00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:11.690
He seemed to feel lonely
when you were not around.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:12.858
Was he?

00:02:13.008 --> 00:02:15.527
Cheer him up.

00:02:23.043 --> 00:02:25.409
What is Mr. Albert doing?

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:32.116
Come in.

00:02:38.959 --> 00:02:41.253
Does Miss Candice live here?

00:02:41.495 --> 00:02:44.525
Yes, but she is away on a trip.

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:50.594
Candy, it's you!

00:02:52.005 --> 00:02:53.031
Welcome, Candy.

00:02:53.181 --> 00:02:54.539
I am back, Mr. Albert.

00:02:54.808 --> 00:02:56.105
Candy,

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:57.674
there is a letter for you.

00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:00.141
You don't need me to tell you
who is it from, right?

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:01.771
It must be from Terry, right?

00:03:04.985 --> 00:03:07.882
- Oranges...
- A present for you!

00:03:11.725 --> 00:03:13.386
Oh dear...

00:03:13.994 --> 00:03:17.521
It's an invitation card from Terry.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:24.396
If Mr. Albert is recovering well,

00:03:24.546 --> 00:03:26.098
I hope you could come here.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:28.998
Leave everything behind.

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:33.702
Just like in old times
when we were at St. Paul Academy.

00:03:41.488 --> 00:03:45.288
An invitation and a one-way ticket.

00:03:46.526 --> 00:03:48.050
Terry...

00:03:48.561 --> 00:03:49.990
Mr. Albert!

00:03:51.614 --> 00:03:56.074
Terry... Terry invites me to Broadway!

00:03:56.586 --> 00:03:58.019
That's great!

00:03:58.421 --> 00:04:02.777
Candy, don't worry about me,
go without a care!

00:04:03.007 --> 00:04:05.722
Thank you, Mr. Albert!

00:04:17.273 --> 00:04:19.532
I want to see Susanna Marlowe.

00:04:19.712 --> 00:04:24.342
Sorry, but Mrs. Marlowe
refuses to allow you in there.

00:04:24.914 --> 00:04:26.472
I am very sorry.

00:04:26.883 --> 00:04:28.617
Could you hand this to her then?

00:04:30.419 --> 00:04:31.652
Excuse me...

00:04:32.889 --> 00:04:37.883
He comes every day.
I feel so sorry for him!

00:04:38.427 --> 00:04:42.261
Mrs. Marlowe wouldn't even
take any flowers.

00:04:50.273 --> 00:04:54.969
Visit her? Leave!
I don't want to see you!

00:04:55.119 --> 00:04:57.171
I will not forgive you!

00:04:57.413 --> 00:05:03.778
Susanna sacrificed her future for you!

00:05:03.928 --> 00:05:06.414
I hate you!

00:05:06.689 --> 00:05:08.787
Calm down, Mrs. Marlowe.

00:05:09.325 --> 00:05:12.319
That's an accident,
it wasn't Terry's fault!

00:05:12.469 --> 00:05:17.127
No, he destroyed my daughter!

00:05:19.268 --> 00:05:22.868
He needs to be held responsible!

00:05:23.205 --> 00:05:27.107
Give me back my child!

00:05:29.812 --> 00:05:32.474
How can she perform on stage
with only one leg?

00:05:32.748 --> 00:05:37.082
She wanted to be an actress
since she was a little child.

00:05:40.522 --> 00:05:41.648
Susanna,

00:05:44.827 --> 00:05:46.988
If I could, I'd swap places with you.

00:05:47.863 --> 00:05:49.694
I really hope I could!

00:05:50.399 --> 00:05:54.096
Susanna, are you feeling well?

00:05:56.071 --> 00:05:57.902
What are you thinking right now?

00:06:04.179 --> 00:06:06.807
And on that ship...

00:06:06.957 --> 00:06:09.443
You saw Terry for the first time,

00:06:09.593 --> 00:06:13.614
he held you,
you two stared each other...

00:06:14.923 --> 00:06:17.184
Come on, Mr. Albert!

00:06:17.334 --> 00:06:20.092
I have heard it too many times,

00:06:20.996 --> 00:06:22.657
I memorised it by now.

00:06:24.133 --> 00:06:26.567
Candy, don't be mad.

00:06:27.136 --> 00:06:30.333
I am willing to listen
no matter how many times.

00:06:32.207 --> 00:06:33.900
Thank you, Mr. Albert!

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:36.910
I am so happy!

00:06:42.017 --> 00:06:43.814
She is always so childish...

00:06:44.086 --> 00:06:49.319
The face behind the fog
looked really like Anthony.

00:06:51.159 --> 00:06:53.286
Did I ever mention about Anthony?

00:06:54.796 --> 00:06:58.732
He was your first love.

00:07:00.135 --> 00:07:06.131
No, my first love was
at the age of six.

00:07:06.541 --> 00:07:08.535
The prince on the hill.

00:07:08.685 --> 00:07:11.078
First love at the age of six...

00:07:13.281 --> 00:07:15.140
That's pretty early!

00:07:22.223 --> 00:07:24.214
The prince on the hill...

00:07:34.069 --> 00:07:36.296
Anthony...

00:07:36.446 --> 00:07:38.430
And then Terry.

00:07:40.508 --> 00:07:43.636
No, with Terry is different.

00:07:45.213 --> 00:07:47.174
We will be together again.

00:07:54.089 --> 00:07:56.387
We will be together again!

00:07:56.591 --> 00:07:58.120
Someday.

00:08:07.502 --> 00:08:09.129
We will!

00:08:09.471 --> 00:08:11.965
Even though Mr. Albert lost
his memory,

00:08:12.115 --> 00:08:14.873
we are still reunited.

00:08:16.677 --> 00:08:19.578
Mr. Albert, it's so good to be alive!

00:08:19.814 --> 00:08:21.304
Why do you say that?

00:08:22.516 --> 00:08:23.813
Hold this!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:32.651
Even if we are separated now,
we still have a lot of good memories.

00:08:33.894 --> 00:08:36.328
Thinking about the past.

00:08:38.065 --> 00:08:40.727
Terry in the Blue River Zoo.

00:08:42.236 --> 00:08:45.330
Terry's smile
under the spring sunshine.

00:08:46.474 --> 00:08:48.840
And the May Festival.

00:09:14.502 --> 00:09:16.600
Our first kiss...

00:09:24.378 --> 00:09:28.474
We missed each other so many times
since we left school.

00:10:02.783 --> 00:10:05.251
But this time I am sure
I will see Terry!

00:10:06.353 --> 00:10:08.715
I can't wait to go to Broadway!

00:10:09.256 --> 00:10:10.223
Candy!

00:10:12.626 --> 00:10:14.590
How many eggs do you want?

00:10:17.398 --> 00:10:19.127
Shoot!

00:10:45.709 --> 00:10:49.771
Lights higher! Good!

00:10:49.921 --> 00:10:52.838
Ropes tight! Good!

00:10:53.116 --> 00:10:55.482
Background more to the right!
Good!

00:10:55.886 --> 00:10:59.549
A little more! Good!

00:11:02.893 --> 00:11:04.252
That's so cruel.

00:11:04.402 --> 00:11:08.627
The rehearsal continues
even after Susanna's accident.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:14.535
Terrius.

00:11:15.939 --> 00:11:18.767
Karen Kreis will be playing Juliet
from now on.

00:11:18.917 --> 00:11:21.236
Get along well.

00:11:21.778 --> 00:11:23.575
Nice meeting you, Terry.

00:11:24.681 --> 00:11:27.856
I can do better than Susanna.

00:11:28.306 --> 00:11:29.751
It's nice meeting you too, Karen.

00:11:35.158 --> 00:11:38.359
Director Robert only cares
about the performance on stage.

00:11:39.329 --> 00:11:40.689
This is the real life.

00:11:40.839 --> 00:11:43.790
But I just can't leave Susanna behind.

00:11:49.706 --> 00:11:52.534
You're going to Broadway tomorrow.

00:11:53.943 --> 00:11:57.936
I need to get something first.

00:11:58.781 --> 00:12:00.681
Be careful.

00:12:01.718 --> 00:12:04.410
Candy, don't get too excited.

00:12:13.396 --> 00:12:15.830
I'm going to Broadway tomorrow!

00:12:16.165 --> 00:12:18.030
With the first train!

00:12:23.206 --> 00:12:26.539
Candy didn't even see us, Brother.

00:12:27.377 --> 00:12:28.770
Oh well...

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:31.139
Why is she so happy?

00:12:31.589 --> 00:12:33.311
Of course, Archie!

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:38.148
Yeah, Candy is going to see Terry.

00:12:40.289 --> 00:12:42.924
Miss, you dropped ten dollars.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:45.219
Really?

00:12:45.369 --> 00:12:46.921
Hello, Candy.

00:12:47.071 --> 00:12:48.623
You are in a real good mood, huh?

00:12:49.298 --> 00:12:51.893
You guys!

00:12:52.043 --> 00:12:53.461
For how long
have you been following me?

00:12:53.611 --> 00:12:56.198
You were so excited
and you didn't see us at all.

00:12:56.639 --> 00:13:00.615
We want to have a farewell dinner
with you.

00:13:00.965 --> 00:13:04.845
Sorry,
I was going to get something.

00:13:05.882 --> 00:13:07.041
Hop on.

00:13:07.191 --> 00:13:08.845
We are going with you, Candy.

00:13:09.252 --> 00:13:10.645
Thanks!

00:13:10.795 --> 00:13:14.622
Candy,
we can help you with the dinner.

00:13:15.258 --> 00:13:16.584
Great!

00:13:16.734 --> 00:13:20.356
Are you sure? Can you cook
something that is edible?

00:13:20.863 --> 00:13:22.387
How rude!

00:13:40.049 --> 00:13:43.043
Yeah, I will buy Terry a scarf!

00:13:43.193 --> 00:13:45.446
Candy,
you should buy that in New York.

00:13:45.596 --> 00:13:49.514
Yeah,
they have more good taste over there.

00:13:49.792 --> 00:13:51.555
Right.

00:13:58.667 --> 00:13:59.994
Look! How beautiful are those roses!

00:14:00.344 --> 00:14:03.830
I will get some for Terry.

00:14:04.073 --> 00:14:08.169
Candy, do you have any idea
how far Broadway is actually?

00:14:08.611 --> 00:14:11.341
The flowers are going to die.

00:14:11.614 --> 00:14:13.023
Yeah.

00:14:13.173 --> 00:14:14.520
Here comes the ice cream!

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:16.310
Hey, Stear!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:21.452
It's going to melt
before it reaches Terry.

00:14:22.157 --> 00:14:25.452
Candy, we are going to eat it now.

00:14:25.602 --> 00:14:28.155
Stop thinking about Terry.

00:14:30.966 --> 00:14:33.658
Come, the ice cream tastes
a lot better in winter.

00:14:36.472 --> 00:14:39.032
The strawberry flavour is delicious!

00:14:39.908 --> 00:14:42.240
I want a hat as well.

00:14:43.111 --> 00:14:45.011
Are you serious, Eliza?

00:14:48.617 --> 00:14:49.676
Candy!

00:14:49.826 --> 00:14:51.612
How peasant!

00:14:51.762 --> 00:14:54.015
Eating ice cream on the street.

00:14:54.823 --> 00:14:57.017
I would rather be uneducated

00:14:57.167 --> 00:14:59.686
and eat ice cream on the street.

00:14:59.836 --> 00:15:01.121
This is so good!

00:15:01.371 --> 00:15:03.157
Eliza, you want some?

00:15:03.507 --> 00:15:07.456
Don't be as bad as Candy.

00:15:07.606 --> 00:15:09.433
Let's go, brother.

00:15:10.639 --> 00:15:15.969
Candy, I am going to Broadway
to watch a play.

00:15:16.119 --> 00:15:18.305
Do you know who the leading actor is?

00:15:18.555 --> 00:15:22.708
It's Terrius.
I will have a chat with him.

00:15:23.952 --> 00:15:26.921
You should go back
to your patients and bandages.

00:16:06.461 --> 00:16:11.458
Candy, why don't you tell Eliza
that you are going to Broadway too?

00:16:11.608 --> 00:16:12.692
Yeah.

00:16:12.842 --> 00:16:13.827
That's alright.

00:16:13.977 --> 00:16:16.496
Eliza likes to tease me.

00:16:16.646 --> 00:16:18.869
I don't want to disappoint her...

00:16:31.352 --> 00:16:34.047
Mrs. Marlowe is not here.

00:16:34.197 --> 00:16:36.649
Do you want
to go straight to the ward?

00:16:36.799 --> 00:16:41.184
Upstairs, turn right. Ward No. 12.

00:16:42.931 --> 00:16:44.159
Thank you!

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.283
Come in.

00:17:11.192 --> 00:17:12.250
Terry!

00:17:14.895 --> 00:17:16.157
Susanna...

00:17:18.899 --> 00:17:22.027
You come here every day.

00:17:23.938 --> 00:17:25.803
I know.

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:28.130
Thank you.

00:17:28.776 --> 00:17:29.902
Don't mention it.

00:17:30.052 --> 00:17:33.003
How are the rehearsals going?

00:17:33.347 --> 00:17:38.155
I heard Karen got the role of Juliet.

00:17:38.953 --> 00:17:40.446
She must be very happy.

00:17:40.596 --> 00:17:43.217
She always wanted this role.

00:17:45.659 --> 00:17:48.526
The premiere is near.

00:17:51.632 --> 00:17:54.032
She is coming, isn't she?

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.460
She?

00:17:58.772 --> 00:18:00.797
Candice White.

00:18:03.844 --> 00:18:08.008
Yeah, Candy is coming.

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:12.080
I don't want to cause
any misunderstanding.

00:18:15.022 --> 00:18:17.820
Forget about her!

00:18:18.892 --> 00:18:21.617
Look how I become because of you!

00:18:21.767 --> 00:18:30.029
You are responsible to take care of me
for the rest of my life.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:40.742
I didn't mean it, Terry!

00:18:41.682 --> 00:18:44.242
I won't force you.

00:18:48.689 --> 00:18:49.948
Susanna...

00:18:50.098 --> 00:18:53.959
It's not your fault!

00:18:55.295 --> 00:18:57.559
I don't hate you at all.

00:18:59.366 --> 00:19:00.726
Terry...

00:19:00.876 --> 00:19:04.532
Don't bother about me,
concentrate on your performance.

00:19:05.238 --> 00:19:07.035
And be...

00:19:09.276 --> 00:19:12.541
Be happy with her!

00:19:15.816 --> 00:19:18.284
Please, leave me alone!

00:19:18.518 --> 00:19:22.716
Don't come again, Terry.
Don't come again!

00:19:24.925 --> 00:19:26.688
I will see you tomorrow,

00:19:27.661 --> 00:19:29.094
Susanna.

00:19:45.011 --> 00:19:46.538
Mr. Albert.

00:19:46.688 --> 00:19:50.542
Candy is leaving for Broadway,
we will look after you every day.

00:19:50.992 --> 00:19:52.277
That's kind of you.

00:19:52.427 --> 00:19:54.115
The food is wonderful.

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:59.420
Stear, what's up?

00:19:59.926 --> 00:20:01.386
Nothing.

00:20:01.536 --> 00:20:04.487
For after meal entertainment,
please enjoy my accordion show.

00:20:04.831 --> 00:20:06.525
Brother,

00:20:06.875 --> 00:20:08.860
we are going to have
digestion problems.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:10.662
What are you talking about, Archie?

00:20:10.812 --> 00:20:12.898
Get ready to see this.

00:20:29.489 --> 00:20:31.616
Poope knows how to dance!

00:20:40.233 --> 00:20:42.861
Come, Candy, let's dance!

00:21:10.497 --> 00:21:15.730
Candy  doesn't know anything
about Susanna's suffering.

00:21:16.903 --> 00:21:20.202
She is going to see Terry.

00:21:21.274 --> 00:21:24.209
Candy's heart
is filled with excitement.
